VNN.MX</a>) plans to acquire a Californian biotech firm (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:20;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RNA\">RNA</a>) for $12 billion. And Porsche (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:21;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PAH3.DE\">PAH3.DE</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:22;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/1PORS.MI\">1PORS.MI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:23;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/POAHY\">POAHY</a>) follows <a data-i13n=\"cpos:24;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GM\">GM</a> and Ford (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:25;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/F\">F</a>) in shifting its strategy away from EV's.</p>\n<p>For more live coverage of markets watch the full episode of<a data-i13n=\"cpos:26;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cLr6hc2-oMY&list=PLx28zU8ctIRqTE7Y4uXTY-S2oHlwDsL5c\"> Market Sunrise</a> and head to<a data-i13n=\"cpos:27;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/\"> Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>",
